Ouch, bad luck.

Worse, that death was mostly preventable.  You had unicorn horns
available, so what you should have done was start eating poisonous
corpses (mostly bees, ants, beetles, snakes and spiders), applying the
horn until you cured the strength loss after each meal, until you
gained poison resistance.

Poison resistance is a very important thing to get early, arguably more
important to have than most of the rest of your stuff.

Better luck next game!

